). Each albumin bound PFAS congeners with charged functional groups, as evidenced by concentration dependent PFAS-induced shifts in protein melting temperature (
Table 2
). Consistent with previous findings, no changes in albumin T
M
were detected for any concentration of 6:2 FTOH for any species (
Jackson et al., 2021
;
Table 2
). A unique biphasic melt curve in thermal stability change was exhibited for BSA binding of PFOS (
Fig. 4A
–
