Fig. 5A
; r(12) = .93, p = .0021), 4E99 (
Fig. 5B
; r(12) = .92, p = .0031), and 1H9Z (
Fig. 5C
; r(12) = .91, p = .0039). With the exception of PFBS, there was also a strong correlation between the variables for all tested congeners in 4F5S, the BSA conformer, (
